tion\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientDataJSON"},{"type":"text","text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCredential"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, or bio enrollment."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"iden